{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "d2a97c03f7234a9a90f83215cee13175", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "给团队写一封关于交付准时率的通知", "id": "945b6c052e3d447e8d403b11ee040cba", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:23.610312", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "081b05e7cc9a436e95f1b584140ddae8", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:23.610312"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "根据问题类型判断无需外部工具，直接基于已知信息作答。", "id": "4d550f5743a24d6291b57f17ab07ac9f", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:46.928181", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "各位同事：近期交付准时率有所波动，请各跟单重点关注：1）预测完工与承诺交期偏差>3天的订单须提前预警；2）高风险订单每日站会过一遍；3）发货前 3 天主动同步客户物流信息。本月目标：准时率恢复 95% 以上。", "id": "a2b25629d6584f889774f8a24754fa6a", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:46.928181", "finished_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:46.928181"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "c1be41673fbb4941b2714bc3053dbe0b", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:46.928181", "finished_at": "2026-08-17T20:47:46.928181"}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "什么是凝珠机选型的关键参数", "id": "9a6865bef6a84a67a694dd3976baee74", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:33.916958", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "683a9b8ed3544b5b8fac659034440ec2", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:33.916958"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "根据问题类型判断无需外部工具，直接基于已知信息作答。", "id": "3f3c2bc143c749e3b4bf981256631ce1", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:38.126613", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "凝珠液体包装机选型关注：膜材兼容性（PVA/水溶膜）、成型模温控精度（建议±2℃）、灌装精度（±1%）、产能（每分钟袋数）与换产时间。建议提供样品试机后确定型号。", "id": "094bb4ed798b45beaf78af436bf5b035", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:38.126613", "finished_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:38.126613"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "2c60dcb807d64ab9bfe53f904771d534", "created_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:38.126613", "finished_at": "2026-08-17T20:50:38.126613"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_con